config ROBA_AUTOMOUSE_KEY_CONTROL
    bool "Control the PMW3610 auto mouse layer with key presses"
    default y
    depends on PMW3610 && ZMK_SPLIT_ROLE_CENTRAL
    help
        While the auto mouse layer is active, pressing a key bound on the
        mouse layer restarts its timeout, and pressing any other key exits
        the layer immediately.
